ic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-bafeabc3-7671-4e94-8a87-e7d16519be86\">콜라보 이벤트 기간 중 A2 캐릭터를 획득하고, </span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-91662a7b-6fb2-4b70-8cc3-49c2b8a0d8e7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-ec4637d9-4687-43c1-96fa-4636d03e1a46\">OuteR:Automata 이벤트 업적을 완료하면</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3b2148db-b5ef-48ce-b56f-23d1bb2fb427\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-51bb148f-90b3-4445-98c2-81be3efbfc86\">A2 코스튬 [중파상태]를 획득할 수 있습니다!</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-20804feb-9d35-4c57-8e3a-7d79550a18c0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-3fbbb95f-6b19-4210-b929-0f756e4f36b7\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ed6087bc-4648-434f-adae-799a29b8320a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c9e4ad1c-e6a4-47cd-895e-85dda716bc15\"><b>◆ Pick Up 모집 기간 </b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-96ef1db7-a6c8-4418-8a9c-22fa2876e7b7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-a285d46c-88a1-4c7c-a7ac-82bbfce472d6\">- 7/10(목) 5:00 ~ 7/31(목) 4:59까지</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aea7dc67-5171-4db1-afe0-89b71f76317b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic se-weight-unset  \" id=\"SE-d47b1286-1a1b-4b44-a1fb-8deb0fc071df\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -